这可能确实激发了他继续执导的灵感，但它并不是他的处女作。

213
00:09:26.770 --> 00:09:31.610
He had written, produced, and directed the film Brief Interviews with Hideous Men,
他曾编剧、制片并执导过电影《男人来自地狱》，

214
00:09:31.770 --> 00:09:35.310
based on the short story collection by David Foster Wallace.
改编自大卫·福斯特·华莱士的短篇小说集。

215
00:09:35.970 --> 00:09:36.990
I remember this.
我记得这个。

216
00:09:37.230 --> 00:09:41.190
From the time we did the pilot, John loved this book.
从我们拍试播集的时候起，约翰就非常喜欢这本书。

217
00:09:41.310 --> 00:09:48.050
And I guess he purchased the rights to the book with his first paycheck from the office.
我猜他用拍《办公室》拿到的第一笔片酬买下了这本书的版权。

218
00:09:48.050 --> 00:09:49.870
He had always wanted to adapt it.
他一直想把它改编成电影。

219
00:09:49.970 --> 00:09:51.250
He's so smart like that.
他就是这么聪明。

220
00:09:51.370 --> 00:09:51.970
I know.
我知道。

221
00:09:51.970 --> 00:09:53.530
He's such a forward thinker.
他很有远见。

222
00:09:53.670 --> 00:09:54.170
He is.
确实。

223
00:09:54.570 --> 00:09:57.090
Originally, he was just going to write and produce the film.
起初，他只是打算担任这部电影的编剧和制片人。

224
00:09:57.470 --> 00:10:00.970
Did you know John majored in screenwriting at Brown University?
你知道约翰在布朗大学主修的是剧本创作吗？

225
00:10:01.210 --> 00:10:02.270
I didn't know that.
我不知道。

226
00:10:02.630 --> 00:10:03.150
Yeah.
是的。

227
00:10:03.370 --> 00:10:06.270
So he majored in screenwriting, not acting.
所以他主修的是剧本创作，而不是表演。

228
00:10:06.790 --> 00:10:08.310
Writing was really his first love.
写作才是他的初恋。

229
00:10:08.750 --> 00:10:12.110
So anyway, he had the rights, but he couldn't find a director.
总之，他拿到了版权，却一直找不到合适的导演。

230
00:10:12.990 --> 00:10:19.170
And I guess it was Rainn Wilson who said to him on set one day, why don't you just direct it yourself?
我记得有一天在片场，是雷恩·威尔森对他说，你为什么不自己导呢？

231
00:10:19.670 --> 00:10:20.890
That sounds like Rain, too.
这听起来确实很像雷恩会说的话。

232
00:10:21.290 --> 00:10:24.110
Rainn is very much the person that's like, why don't you just do it?
雷恩就是那种会说“你为什么不直接去做呢”的人。

233
00:10:24.230 --> 00:10:25.590
