264
00:11:20.770 --> 00:11:26.770
Which is that we need to point out what a very big deal it was for John to direct this particular episode.
那就是我们需要指出，约翰执导这一集意义有多重大。

265
00:11:27.030 --> 00:11:31.890
Because he had to establish two new major characters in the show.
因为他必须在剧中引入两个重要的新角色。

266
00:11:32.270 --> 00:11:36.790
Kathy Bates as Joe Bennett and Zach Woods as Gabe Lewis.
凯西·贝茨饰演的乔·贝内特，以及扎克·伍兹饰演的盖博·刘易斯。

267
00:11:37.330 --> 00:11:39.590
And he directed Christian Slater.
而且他还执导了克里斯汀·史莱特。

268
00:11:39.850 --> 00:11:42.910
So this was not just a regular episode of The Office.
所以这不仅仅是《办公室》普通的一集。

269
00:11:42.930 --> 00:11:43.130
That's right.
没错。

270
00:11:43.130 --> 00:11:44.830
He had to do the whole Saber video.
他还得负责整个赛博公司的视频。

271
00:11:45.030 --> 00:11:45.410
Oh, my gosh.
天哪。

272
00:11:45.490 --> 00:11:46.330
